WEBVTT

00:13.125 --> 00:15.416
Leave Chinatown to follow me
and you shall live.

00:15.541 --> 00:17.291
Otherwise, you shall die.

00:20.125 --> 00:22.750
Since the bloody battle at Chinatown,

00:22.875 --> 00:24.166
security has been tightened.

00:24.250 --> 00:26.541
The eradication of rogues
has been accelerated.

00:26.541 --> 00:29.041
The era of territorial rivalry is over.

00:30.666 --> 00:32.875
Long, Phong, Ba

00:33.166 --> 00:36.125
withdrew from the criminal world
according to the wish of Hung Chinatown.

00:36.375 --> 00:39.416
The gangland at that time was a calm lake.

00:40.041 --> 00:43.000
Until someone tries to stir it up.

00:52.625 --> 00:55.416
The blood debt must be paid with blood.

00:57.000 --> 01:00.541
A storm coming from Bac
Cang stirs Chinatown once more.

01:21.291 --> 01:23.291
Hanh! Go to your room! Quick!

01:23.666 --> 01:24.916
Dad!

01:35.916 --> 01:37.291
Hanh!

01:49.000 --> 01:50.416
Hanh!

01:57.416 --> 01:59.916
Hanh!

02:00.291 --> 02:01.416
Hanh!

02:02.916 --> 02:04.125
Hanh!

02:04.166 --> 02:06.291
Hold on! Please hold on!

02:07.458 --> 02:08.583
Hanh!

02:10.541 --> 02:12.291
Hold on! Hold on, okay?

02:13.458 --> 02:15.000
Wait for me.

02:15.291 --> 02:17.291
Hold it tigh! Hold it tight!

02:17.291 --> 02:19.291
Wait for me.

02:34.041 --> 02:35.291
Hanh!

02:38.625 --> 02:39.833
It's me.

02:42.083 --> 02:43.208
I'm sorry.

02:49.666 --> 02:50.875
I'm sorry.

02:53.333 --> 02:56.416
I know you're still alive.

02:58.541 --> 03:00.625
I'm here now. I'm sorry.

04:08.666 --> 04:12.125
[Heading North]

04:12.166 --> 04:15.875
Namo Amitabha.

04:25.833 --> 04:27.083
Big brother.

04:27.125 --> 04:28.500
The kids are on their way.

04:28.750 --> 04:30.000
Thank you.

04:43.958 --> 04:46.916
Hung, we're sorry.
We couldn't protect Hanh.

05:03.291 --> 05:04.625
Run, Boss!

05:05.250 --> 05:06.416
What's up?

05:06.416 --> 05:07.750
Phong is heading to Chinatown for a fight.

05:07.750 --> 05:08.916
What?

05:42.916 --> 05:44.166
Hung!

05:52.541 --> 05:53.750
Hurry up!

06:00.333 --> 06:01.541
Condolences to you.

06:01.625 --> 06:02.708
Thank you.

06:02.750 --> 06:03.750
Have a seat.

06:08.208 --> 06:09.791
Don't be too depressed,

06:09.875 --> 06:11.375
lest it affect your health.

06:12.000 --> 06:14.166
The rest will be handled by the police.

06:16.750 --> 06:19.166
Find me if you need anything.

06:28.000 --> 06:29.583
Thank you.

06:31.291 --> 06:34.375
I'll bother you when I need something.

07:52.250 --> 07:54.791
Phong! Phong!

09:43.187 --> 09:44.343
Do you wanna die?

10:03.541 --> 10:04.875
What the hell, Phong?

10:05.250 --> 10:08.663
What have we promised?
We won't use violence again.

10:09.083 --> 10:10.875
What if I couldn't arrive in time.

10:12.333 --> 10:14.666
Alright, it's good that he's still fine.

10:14.708 --> 10:17.291
No! I must make him understand!

10:18.791 --> 10:20.333
You're talking too much, Ba.

10:20.416 --> 10:23.208
My God!
It bothers me if you don't let me talk.

10:23.250 --> 10:24.916
Jeez, what were you thinking?

10:25.208 --> 10:27.125
Hung isn't here anymore. I fucking
have to take revenge on his behalf.

10:27.125 --> 10:28.500
Alright.

11:32.541 --> 11:34.125
You bitch.

11:34.500 --> 11:36.500
You must pay for that bastard.

11:36.833 --> 11:38.375
Fuck you two!

12:04.666 --> 12:05.916
Dung!

12:06.750 --> 12:08.166
Dung!

12:22.208 --> 12:24.916
You messed with me,
I'll mess with your bitch.

12:24.958 --> 12:28.000
Find me in Bac Cang
if you want your bitch back.

12:28.041 --> 12:29.583
Son of a bitch!

12:57.416 --> 13:02.750
Why are the choices of people
I care about never include me?

13:15.666 --> 13:17.041
Condolences to you.

13:17.750 --> 13:19.916
I know it's difficult

13:20.291 --> 13:21.666
for you to go this time.

13:22.416 --> 13:25.375
But we must catch them all.

13:31.666 --> 13:33.291
Here are what you'll need.

13:34.750 --> 13:38.291
When you arrive,
someone will give you information.

13:43.125 --> 13:44.750
Is that our people?

13:44.958 --> 13:46.333
Yes.

13:46.416 --> 13:47.875
We can trust that one.

13:48.166 --> 13:50.375
She wants to help. That's all.

13:51.416 --> 13:52.958
Hey.

13:53.291 --> 13:55.000
Don't let your emotions take over.

13:57.125 --> 13:58.458
Take care.

14:01.166 --> 14:02.666
Okay.

14:02.750 --> 14:04.125
I got it.

14:38.250 --> 14:40.541
Okay.

14:40.583 --> 14:42.083
Don't worry, Hien.

14:42.208 --> 14:43.416
Thank you.

15:06.250 --> 15:09.250
Wake up, girls. Wake up.

15:10.333 --> 15:12.625
Hey, you. When will you
give me back my money?

15:12.666 --> 15:14.500
- By the end of this month.
- There's a lot.

15:14.500 --> 15:16.625
This one also. Wake up! Still sleeping now?

15:16.666 --> 15:19.083
Chi, can you lend me 150 USD?

15:19.541 --> 15:20.875
I'm starving to death.

15:20.916 --> 15:22.541
Wait til the end of this tonight.

15:22.583 --> 15:25.500
- You!
- Mai, hurry.

15:28.250 --> 15:29.750
Wait a second.

15:29.791 --> 15:32.041
Hey, this lipstick has pretty color.

15:32.250 --> 15:33.833
Can I have it?

15:33.875 --> 15:36.041
Buy it yourself with your money.

15:36.125 --> 15:37.875
You're always asking for free stuff.

15:38.250 --> 15:40.541
I only ask for a few things.

15:51.625 --> 15:52.708
Damn it.

15:52.750 --> 15:55.500
I have been the only one
who works at the port.

15:55.875 --> 15:59.000
There is nobody else. And he dared
to ask for a 50-50 split?

15:59.375 --> 16:02.291
I bear a lot of expenses for goods-
transportation and labor force.

16:02.916 --> 16:04.458
I also have plenty of minions.

16:04.541 --> 16:06.458
50-50 is not a good deal for me.

16:08.250 --> 16:12.000
Hey, I left a bottle of wine here.
Bring it for me.

16:12.291 --> 16:13.958
Yes, sir.

16:14.500 --> 16:17.166
Even Mr. Six Knots
has never forced me like this.

16:17.291 --> 16:19.666
50-50 split? Nonsense.

16:20.416 --> 16:22.041
Don't say that.

16:22.125 --> 16:23.625
Ky is different.

16:23.666 --> 16:24.750
Different my ass.

16:24.791 --> 16:26.583
I must obtain more shares of East port.

16:30.250 --> 16:32.833
If a 50-50 split doesn't sound good,
how about a 60-40 split?

16:33.416 --> 16:36.250
Then go work with him.
I don't fucking need it.

16:59.791 --> 17:00.958
Babe

17:05.583 --> 17:06.791
Have a drink.

17:15.291 --> 17:16.875
A 50-50 split, huh?

17:25.166 --> 17:26.333
Brother Nam.

17:27.416 --> 17:28.708
Have a drink.

17:35.750 --> 17:37.083
A 60-40 split, huh?

18:59.916 --> 19:03.416
Be good, my baby. I'll take you
and mommy out when you recover.

19:03.458 --> 19:04.958
Stop touching my belly.

19:05.083 --> 19:07.000
I told you it's not good to touch too much.

19:07.125 --> 19:08.750
I can't eat anymore. I'm full.

19:09.416 --> 19:11.000
Then I'll save it for your evening meal.

19:11.041 --> 19:12.208
Okay.

19:16.291 --> 19:17.625
I'll give you a massage.

19:29.333 --> 19:30.458
Good morning, Sir

19:30.500 --> 19:32.500
- Have you made a reservation yet?
- Ah no.

19:32.875 --> 19:33.916
I'm looking for Ms. Kim.

19:33.958 --> 19:35.916
Kim? She is not here at the moment.

19:35.916 --> 19:37.375
Can you come back later?

19:38.083 --> 19:40.416
Oh, you can give me your phone number.

19:40.500 --> 19:42.166
I'll give it to Kim for you.

19:42.208 --> 19:43.708
That's okay.

20:10.541 --> 20:11.500
Hello?

20:11.541 --> 20:13.458
What the hell are you doing?
Why didn't you answer my call?

20:13.500 --> 20:14.833
Where are you now?

20:15.250 --> 20:17.416
I… I'm in my hometown.

20:17.833 --> 20:20.000
But what's up? What happened?
How is the food stall?

20:20.708 --> 20:22.041
A damn mess.

20:22.125 --> 20:23.375
Do you have money?

20:23.916 --> 20:25.125
What's wrong?

20:25.416 --> 20:26.666
Nothing.

20:26.958 --> 20:29.458
Hey! Do not act without considering first.

20:29.875 --> 20:33.166
Hey, be careful of Hac Hung's gang.

20:33.291 --> 20:34.541
Wait for me to come back.

20:34.625 --> 20:36.250
Okay. Bye.

20:43.541 --> 20:44.916
I hope you'll do well

20:45.583 --> 20:47.500
on my behalf for this trip.

20:49.208 --> 20:50.541
Don't worry.

20:51.916 --> 20:54.000
I'll make them pay for everything.

20:58.166 --> 21:00.041
Your problems are mine too.

21:01.625 --> 21:03.250
The problem of Chinatown this time,

21:05.166 --> 21:06.583
I'll leave it to you guys.

21:15.666 --> 21:17.166
Take a rest.

21:39.250 --> 21:42.250
You're touching again.
I said it's not good.

21:43.833 --> 21:45.333
Doesn't Hien's car look nice?

21:45.541 --> 21:47.250
Of course. It looks excellent.

21:47.416 --> 21:49.291
I've been practicing
with this car recently.

21:49.333 --> 21:50.708
- Really?
- Yeah.

21:50.750 --> 21:52.666
When I'm rich, I will get one

21:52.708 --> 21:54.375
to drive you and our baby everywhere.

21:54.500 --> 21:55.791
Okay.

21:56.458 --> 21:58.708
Phong! Slow down!

21:58.875 --> 22:01.166
It's too shaky, it might affect the baby.

22:02.458 --> 22:03.750
Stop touching!

22:12.125 --> 22:15.000
Hurry up, everyone!
The bus is about to depart!

22:18.541 --> 22:20.083
- Ouch.
- Take it slow, honey.

22:22.333 --> 22:23.833
Goodbye, Phong.

22:26.583 --> 22:28.375
Slow down, you're pregnant.

22:36.250 --> 22:37.750
I'll get my luggage.

22:41.958 --> 22:43.333
- I'm leaving!
- Ba!

22:45.916 --> 22:47.375
What's up man?

22:54.541 --> 22:57.416
Are you crazy? I'm just taking
her back home. Gift giving for what?

22:57.958 --> 22:59.291
Just take it.

23:02.500 --> 23:03.875
Where's this much money?

23:03.916 --> 23:05.750
Who gave you these money?
Who did you borrow these from?

23:05.791 --> 23:07.625
Nonsense! It's my saving.

23:07.916 --> 23:09.958
Consider it as the money
to pay for my mom's debt.

23:10.708 --> 23:11.416
Okay? Go.

23:11.416 --> 23:13.500
I won't accept this money
unless you tell me who it belongs to.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.541
Do your best to take care of Ut Det.

23:17.833 --> 23:18.666
Go!

23:18.708 --> 23:20.583
Hurry! We're departing.

23:20.708 --> 23:22.125
Go! Go!

23:22.958 --> 23:24.291
Take care of yourself.

23:26.083 --> 23:28.125
- I feel awkward!
- Awkward my ass.

23:53.291 --> 23:54.833
Has Hien told you everything needed?

23:55.125 --> 23:56.250
Yes.

24:07.416 --> 24:08.875
What are you doing?

24:10.208 --> 24:11.666
Big brother, let me go with you.

24:13.416 --> 24:14.750
Excuse me.

24:18.083 --> 24:20.375
- Are you crazy?
- You're the crazy one.

24:20.625 --> 24:22.291
You risk your life to give me money.

24:22.333 --> 24:23.708
I'm silly, but I'm not dumb.

24:23.750 --> 24:25.041
You're a dumb cow!

24:25.041 --> 24:28.625
We travel there to avenge Hanh.
We don't even know if we're gonna make it.

24:28.625 --> 24:31.458
Who will take care of Ut Det
when you're gone?

24:31.500 --> 24:33.375
Her mom will. I'll follow you.

24:33.750 --> 24:35.333
- For what?
- To take care of you.

24:36.474 --> 24:37.682
As if I fucking need you.

24:39.307 --> 24:40.724
Are you trying to be the hero here?

24:41.057 --> 24:42.682
I don't want you to die like Hung.

24:43.016 --> 24:44.474
Damn you!

24:45.641 --> 24:47.141
My mom's dead.

24:47.266 --> 24:48.807
And so is my dad!

24:49.099 --> 24:51.141
I only have you as my brother.

24:51.266 --> 24:52.641
Damn you!

25:01.599 --> 25:03.391
I'll drive if you don't drive.

25:40.458 --> 25:41.834
[Cat Bi International Airport]

25:41.859 --> 25:47.035
Please the last passengers on the flight...

25:50.311 --> 25:51.288
- Hello, Big brother.
- Hello, Big brother.

25:51.313 --> 25:52.354
After you.

26:01.035 --> 26:02.956
- Please.
- This car is for the big brother.

26:02.981 --> 26:04.014
Please move to the other car
for more space.

26:04.039 --> 26:04.866
That car is empty.

26:04.891 --> 26:06.349
VIP treatment is indeed different.

26:07.161 --> 26:09.211
I'll give you one when I become the boss.

26:40.391 --> 26:41.849
Hey, dude.

26:41.849 --> 26:44.099
Is there any unique cuisine out here?

26:44.474 --> 26:45.849
Do Son chicken.

26:46.182 --> 26:48.599
- Phong. Let's try special chicken here.
- What?

26:48.807 --> 26:50.349
What kind of chicken?

26:52.099 --> 26:53.724
"45kg chicks."

26:54.557 --> 26:57.141
Dude, can you take us to try it out
when you're free?

26:57.682 --> 26:59.182
Why are you so excited?

26:59.182 --> 27:01.182
Are you crazy?
Ut Det would kill me if she knew.

27:01.266 --> 27:02.974
I'm asking for you.

27:04.641 --> 27:06.349
You're really my best friend.

27:19.224 --> 27:20.641
Wait. Where is Big brother going?

27:22.599 --> 27:25.974
Don't worry. VIP treatment is different.

27:35.849 --> 27:38.682
How is Kim's business doing?

27:40.599 --> 27:41.932
Pretty good, sir.

28:12.016 --> 28:13.432
Are you being agitated?
